          <p style="margin:0;">of surveyed organizations reported using AI in at least one business function in 2025.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="flex:1 1 240px;min-width:0;padding:20px;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid #5a76a3;border-radius:12px;background:#263245b3;">
          <div style="font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:8px;">70%</div>
          <p style="margin:0;">of surveyed organizations reported using generative AI in at least one business function.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="flex:1 1 240px;min-width:0;padding:20px;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid #5a76a3;border-radius:12px;background:#263245b3;">
